EmailTemplate.textOnly:
A Commissions Office Analyst has requested more information regarding your case.

Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
Status: {!Case.Status}

Your immediate attention is required. Click the link below to view the requested information in the "Commissions Case Comments" section.  Add a new Case Comment to provide requested information or ask clarifying questions.

{!Case.Core_AAQC_Commission_InquiryId_Hyperlink__c}


If no response/Case Comment is received from you within 3-5 business days of this email we will send you one, follow up email. If no response/Case Comment is received within 5 business days of the follow up email the case will be closed automatically.

***NOTE: Do not reply to this mail as there is no inbox being monitored***
